      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hey @gprocida@google.com / @maennich@google.com is the qcom symbol list so long here because we\u0027re not referencing android/abi_gki_aarch64 in define_common_kernels on 6.1? Should we be?",
      "revId": "33425f0a6dc1ab0b69af7e573680db736b870e3e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "18744cb0_ca259584",
