      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-05T00:24:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, so it sounds like it should be on us to fix up `define_common_kernels`, and then rebase this series on top? Understanding that we don\u0027t expect the symbol list generated here to change afterwards.\n\nI was thinking that the symbols present in `android/abi_gki_aarch64` would not need to be specified in vendor lists, but looks like that\u0027s incorrect.",
      "parentUuid": "18744cb0_ca259584",
      "revId": "33425f0a6dc1ab0b69af7e573680db736b870e3e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
